# mixmusic
===
 MixMusic: Spotify and YouTube Music in one player. Open-source desktop music player for macOS, Windows & Linux: one search, one queue, mixed playlists, synced lyrics, and equalizer with community themes and plugins. Using Native UI by MyGo.
